# Architecture

Keep authentication, discovery, research analysis, email generation, sending, and database access in separate modules under `lib/`.

Provider interfaces live in:

- `lib/search/provider.ts` (`SearchProvider`)
- `lib/llm/provider.ts` (`LLMProvider`)
- `lib/research/provider.ts` (`ProfessorResearchProvider`)
- `lib/email/provider.ts` (`EmailProvider`)

Do not collapse those concerns into giant files. UI pages must not call Microsoft Graph, crawl the web, or invoke LLMs directly. Route handlers and server-only services own those side effects.

Prefer replaceable providers over hard-coding OpenAI, Tavily, or Graph SDK details in feature code.
